   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:13",
   "text": "Clean comparison. Logging the first one's color.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 4,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:14",
   "text": "Same trip: Identical except for the color, and the second one is the one I'd leave.",
   "images": [
    "yellow/solid_long_skirt.jpg",
    "beige/solid_long_skirt.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 5,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:15",
   "text": "One variable, one verdict. The second one's color is out.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 6,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:16",
   "text": "Also in the bag: Two colors of the same piece. The first one is the version I avoid.",
   "images": [
    "red/solid_windbreaker.jpg",
    "navy/solid_windbreaker.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 7,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:17",
   "text": "Understood — the first one's color goes on the no list.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 8,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:10",
   "text": "Big closet purge tonight. The keep pile and the donate pile are both growing.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 9,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:11",
   "text": "Brutal honesty hour. What's surviving?",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 10,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:12",
   "text": "I keep replacing this cut rather than trying anything else.",
   "images": [
    "brown/solid_sweater.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 11,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:13",
   "text": "Replacing rather than switching says it all. That cut is yours.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 12,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:14",
   "text": "Next out of the pile: These three look nothing alike, but they share exactly one thing — and that shared print is my favorite.",
   "images": [
    "gray/leopard_windbreaker.jpg",
    "navy/leopard_long_coat.jpg",
    "gray/leopard_t_shirt.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 13,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:15",
   "text": "Spotted it. Whatever print those three have in common belongs to you.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 14,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:16",
   "text": "Same sort: This is exactly my favorite cut. I own it in every version I can find.",
   "images": [
    "gray/solid_slacks.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 15,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:17",
   "text": "Noted — that cut is officially yours.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 16,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:10",
   "text": "My aunt's birthday box arrived. Mixed results, as usual.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 17,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:11",
   "text": "Aunt boxes are pure gambling. How did the wheel land?",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 18,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:12",
   "text": "Different pieces, one shared print. That print is the reason none of them worked.",
   "images": [
    "brown/polka_dot_hoodie.jpg",
    "navy/polka_dot_long_coat.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 19,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:13",
   "text": "The common thread is the problem. Noted.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 20,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:14",
   "text": "She also sent this: Same thing twice, split by the print. I'd never take the second one.",
   "images": [
    "pink/floral_dress.jpg",
