   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:15",
   "text": "Clean comparison. The second one's print is banned.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 22,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:16",
   "text": "Next out of the box: These two differ in every way but one: every one of them is the same cut, and that cut is my favorite.",
